<!-- Airfield grid name 'Airfield - <Site>' (owner 2026-11-03, to match the depots' 'Vehicle Depot - <Site>'). A second profile for the same reason as the depots: one name-generator pattern feeds both the grid name and the beacon text; the group lists this one first. -->
